Package: dsImagingClient
Type: Package
Title: DataSHIELD Client for Clinical Imaging Workflows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(person("David", "Sarrat González", , "david.sarrat@isglobal.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Xavier", "Escribà-Montagut", , "xavier.escriba@isglobal.org", role = c("aut")),
      person("Juan R", "González", , "juanr.gonzalez@isglobal.org", role = c("aut")))
Description: Client-side DataSHIELD package for clinical imaging. Provides
    functions to initialize imaging handles, query dataset metadata and asset
    catalogs, define segmentation and radiomics profiles, submit dsJobs-backed
    imaging workflows, monitor per-image collection processing, and discover
    derived masks and radiomic feature tables.
